 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Data Exchange API (2017-07-25). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Owned data sets and their revisions are stored metadata: no asset, import or export job, event action, data grant, product, subscription or API asset call exists, and CreateJob, StartJob, SendApiAsset and other asset APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Revisions stay empty and are never revoked; a data set with revisions cannot be deleted until its revisions are deleted. Tags are stored from CreateDataSet and CreateRevision and returned by the resource reads; TagResource, UntagResource and ListTagsForResource are not implemented.",
  "title": "AWS Data Exchange (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2017-07-25"
 },
